          "chunk_text": "Question: What are your clinic hours and locations?\nAnswer: We are open Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM at 15a Willson St. The nearest free parking is a 3-minute walk away at the Mega Mall parking garage (9 Willson St.).",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 22,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.38327023,
          "dense_rank": 2,
          "lexical_score": 2.1101222,
          "lexical_rank": 7,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.36581975,
          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## While you wait\n\nFree guest Wi-Fi is available in the waiting area: the network is called VisitDoc-Guest, and the password is printed on the card at the front desk. Please set your phone to silent and take calls outside. Photography and video recording are not allowed in the waiting area, to protect other patients' privacy.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.36411995,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": 2.3826423,
          "lexical_rank": 3,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Phone calls\n\nIf we cannot reach you by phone, we leave a voicemail with only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never the reason for the call or any health details.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.35368347,
          "dense_rank": 5,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Bringing someone with you\n\nYou may bring one adult companion into the consulting room. Anyone else who comes with you can wait in the waiting area.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 28,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.35297012,
          "dense_rank": 6,
          "lexical_score": 2.0303502,
          "lexical_rank": 9,
          "considered": false,
