          "similarity_score": 0.34961832,
          "dense_rank": 8,
          "lexical_score": 2.2814288,
          "lexical_rank": 6,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Text message reminders\n\nWe send a reminder by text message 48 hours before your appointment and another 2 hours before it. Our messages always c",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.34331593,
          "dense_rank": 9,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## The self-check-in kiosk\n\nReturning patients can check in at the kiosk beside the front desk instead of queuing. Scan the QR code from your 48-hour reminder text, or ty",
          "text_truncated": true
